OL,3,GNEWSAPerson stabbed to death at council
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has died after being stabbed
OL,7,Fin north-west London, the London
OL,8,FAmbulance Service has said.
OL,10,FThe service said it was called at 14:25
OL,11,FBST to Brent Civic Centre - the home of
OL,12,FBrent Council - and sent ambulances and
OL,13,FLondon's Air Ambulance. The patient was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene, which is
OL,15,Fnear Wembley Stadium.
OL,17,FEngineers Way is closed between Empire
OL,18,FWay and Exhibition Way, with the 92 and
OL,19,F440 bus routes affected.
OL,21,FThe Metropolitan Police has been
OL,22,Fapproached for comment.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
